    "detail": {
      "id": 1000970,
      "name": "[Affinity] Back to Prime",
      "desc": "Evelyn has evoked the Mindscape: <color=#FFAF2C>[Dance of Fire]</color>. After launching a Dash Attack or Dodge Counter, your character can <color=#2BAD00>immediately follow up with</color> certain attacks near the end of the Basic Attack combo.\n[Dance of Fire]: Evelyn's ATK increases by 15%. When Evelyn uses <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Garrote - First Form</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Garrote - Second Form</color>, the <color=#FFFFFF>Burning Embers</color> consumed will be returned. This effect can trigger once every 25s. When Evelyn consumes <color=#FFFFFF>Burning Tether Point</color> to trigger <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack: Lunalux - Snare</color>, the skill's Interrupt Level increases.",
      "desc2": "Evelyn's in perfect condition — or rather, her skills are on point. She said, \"It feels like I'm back in my prime when I used to go on missions.\" As for the details, let's just say it's best not to ask...",
